# No barrels

Import every public symbol from **its own file**. Never a package root or folder `index`. Each design component is a folder: `{Name}/{Name}.tsx`.

```ts
// yes
import { Button } from '@eden-ecommerce/design/primitives/actions/Button/Button';
import { EdenHeader } from '@eden-ecommerce/design/eden/header/EdenHeader/EdenHeader';

// no
import { Button, EdenHeader } from '@eden-ecommerce/design';
import { EdenHeader } from '@eden-ecommerce/design/eden/header';
```

Law:

- Published `@eden-ecommerce/design` has no `index.ts` / `index.tsx` under src and no `"."` root export.
- No `export * from` / re-export barrels in this repo either.
- Consumers: ESLint `no-restricted-imports` blocks bare `@eden-ecommerce/design`.
- Gate (design repo): `pnpm --filter @eden-ecommerce/design check:conventions`.
